ki/Knight%20Armor\"><img alt=\"Knight Armor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Knight_Armor_687863.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Springsprout Rod\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Springsprout_Rod_2f1474.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.50<br/>July 7, 2014<br/>Summer Update 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nLocated just outside <a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton\">Rathleton</a>, the Western Plains are a very good hunting place for those looking for a high experience per hour at the cost of a huge waste. Hunting here is specially good when the Quara Scouts raid is active, because it greatly increases the experience gained. This raid can start (and end) at any moment, but it's not announced. Because if happens quite often, it may be a good idea to start hunting here even without the raid as there is a good chance it will start at any moment. \n</p><p>Since none of the creatures here drop any really valuable loot, the hunt strategy for mages and paladins here usually consists of completely ignoring loot to maximize the experience per hour. This allows you to constantly move into the spawn looking for more creatures and don't walk back to open corpses. \n</p><p>This spawn can be reached from <a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton\">Rathleton</a> by levitating down <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33574,31916,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33574, 31916, 6)</a> or by crossing the bridge from the <a href=\"#/wiki/Workshop%20Quarter\">Workshop Quarter</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33604,31953,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33604, 31953, 7)</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Lower%20Rathleton\">Lower Rathleton</a> and then walking west.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Permanent Spawn</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Blob\"><img alt=\"Glooth Blob\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Glooth_Blob_ec709c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Blob\">Glooth Blob</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">700</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">750</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">462 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">290 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">172 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" 